down_write(&card->controls_rwsem);
old = snd_ctl_find_id(card, &id);
```
- Grabs the control lock and looks up an existing control element to replace.

### c. Handling Replacement

```c
if (!old) {
	if (add_on_replace)
		goto add;
	up_write(&card->controls_rwsem);
