- Premature release (free) of a memory structure that’s still in use.
- Release/free call placement inside a conditional, so it might execute at the wrong time.
- The fix: move the memory cleanup after all necessary use to guarantee it won’t be used-after-freed.

### Step 2: Understanding the Code Control Flow

```c
