- The code does avoid using user-influenced or "work flags" to decide whether to acquire references.
- It does not appear to have the conditional skips present in the vulnerable code pattern described.
- The file (and personality) resources are acquired along direct, clear code paths, dependent on operation configuration — not on transient flags set elsewhere.

